		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A crafted, life-sized, faceless poppet embedded with a soul. Like dolls, retain part of their captive soul's prior self.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 23, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +4 (1d8) or 1 spell +2, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> *, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Alignment</strong>. d6: 1. Lawful, 2-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fear (Lawful CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. One LV 4 or lower creature within near flees for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Neutral</strong>. 4-6. Chaotic.</p><p></p><p><strong>Perplex (Chaotic CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. One LV 4 or lower creature within near dazed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vanish (Neutral CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Turn invisible for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
